              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а) <span data-inline-latex=\"x=-\\frac{\\pi}{12}+\\pi k\"></span>,  <span data-inline-latex=\"x=-\\frac{5\\pi}{12}+\\pi k\"></span>,  где <span data-inline-latex=\"k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> ; б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{41\\pi}{12};-\\frac{37\\pi}{12}\"></span> . </p>",
