              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">За­ме­тим, что <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{12}+x\\right)=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\frac{\\pi}{12}+x\\right)=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}+x\\right).\"></span> Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние:<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"7c2bf2bb-4f87-48dc-9c07-d0cd34126c4d\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/7c2bf2bb-4f87-48dc-9c07-d0cd34126c4d\"/></p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"8\\sin^{2} (\\frac{7\\pi}{12}+x)-2\\sqrt{3}\\cos 2x=5\\iff 8\\cos^{2} (\\frac{\\pi}{12}+x)-2\\sqrt{3}\\cos 2x=5\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff 4(2\\cos^{2} (\\frac{\\pi}{12}+x)-1)+4-2\\sqrt{3}\\cos 2x=5\\iff 4\\cos (\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2x)+4-2\\sqrt{3}\\cos 2x=5\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff 4(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cos 2x-\\frac{1}{2}\\sin 2x)+4-2\\sqrt{3}\\cos 2x=5\\iff 2\\sqrt{3}\\cos 2x-2\\sin 2x-2\\sqrt{3}\\cos 2x=1\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff 2\\sin 2x=-1\\iff \\sin 2x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}2x=-\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\\\2x=-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=-\\frac{\\pi}{12}+\\pi k\\\\x=-\\frac{5\\pi}{12}+\\pi k\\\\k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span></span> </p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">С по­мо­щью чис­ло­вой окруж­но­сти (см. рис.) отберём корни, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{7\\pi}{2};-\\frac{5\\pi}{2}]\"></span> .  По­лу­чим числа  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{41\\pi}{12};-\\frac{37\\pi}{12}\"></span> . <p><b>При­ме­ча­ние.</b></p></li></ol>",
