            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:13:30.785075+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"3\\ctg x+\\frac{1}{\\cos x}=\\tg x+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sin x}\"></span> . </li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Най­ди­те все корни урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{\\pi}{2};\\frac{7\\pi}{6}]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:13:30.785075+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><nobr>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{-\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k;\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ; </nobr> <nobr>б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </nobr></p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:13:30.785075+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Урав­не­ние опре­де­ле­но, если  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x\\ne 0\"></span> и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x\\ne 0\"></span>.  Для таких зна­че­ний <i>x</i> можно умно­жить обе части урав­не­ния на   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x\\cos x\"></span>: <center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"3\\cdot \\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}+\\frac{1}{\\cos x}=\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sin x}\\iff 3\\cos^{2} x+\\sin x=\\sin^{2} x+\\sqrt{3}\\cos x\\iff 3\\cos^{2} x-\\sin^{2} x-(\\sqrt{3}\\cos x-\\sin x)=0\\iff (\\sqrt{3}\\cos x-\\sin x)(\\sqrt{3}\\cos x+\\sin x)-(\\sqrt{3}\\cos x-\\sin x)=0\\iff (\\sqrt{3}\\cos x-\\sin x)(\\sqrt{3}\\cos x+\\sin x-1)=0\"></span>.</span></p></center><p>При­рав­ня­ем каж­дую из ско­бок к нулю. Пер­вый слу­чай: </p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{3}\\cos x-\\sin x=0\\iff \\sin x=\\sqrt{3}\\cos x\\iff \\tg x=\\sqrt{3}\\iff x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </span></p></center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"b100938d-b3e1-4867-9bd9-617ce4f889c9\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p> Вто­рое урав­не­ние решим ме­то­дом вве­де­ния вспо­мо­га­тель­но­го угла:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x+\\sqrt{3}\\cos x=1\\Leftrightarrow 2\\sin\\left(x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)=1\\Leftrightarrow \\sin\\left(x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\Leftrightarrow \\left[\\begin{aligned}x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}&amp;=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k,\\\\x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}&amp;=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow \\left[\\begin{aligned}x&amp;=-\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k,\\\\x&amp;=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2\\pi k,\\end{aligned}\\right.\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}.\"></span></span></p></center><p> Серия  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2\\pi k\"></span>  не вхо­дит в ОДЗ урав­не­ния. </p><p>Таким об­ра­зом, ре­ше­ни­я­ми яв­ля­ют­ся <nobr> серии  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k\"></span> </nobr> и  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\"></span>. </p></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти (см. рис.). Под­хо­дят <nobr>числа  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\"></span> </nobr> и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
